From eea80e802025151173aabccdd453c8b03452451b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jeandre Coetzer <j.coetzer@paradigmengineers.com.au>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 10:15:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add BTC toolchanger card

Adds a dashboard card for hotend-swapping toolchangers that run the
BTC (Bikin Toolchanger) macros, e.g. Lineux Hotswap. Each hotend is
shown with its filament colour, temperature and fan speed; clicking
one opens a dialog to select the tool, set its temperature, edit its
offsets and pick a Spoolman spool (via the existing spool selection
dialog with targetMacro).

The card is only shown when the btc_dashboard Klipper add-on is
loaded (printer.btc_dashboard), like the MMU and AFC cards.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Sh7jAWuaMdMWk4mskJqshZ
